# Mirrors the redirects in netlify.toml. Both files ship, so they have to
# agree — a rule added to one and not the other is a route that works on some
# deploys and not others.
#
# Order matters: the SPA catch-all is last, or it would swallow the API paths
# and answer them with index.html.

/api/lab/chat    /.netlify/functions/lab-chat    200
/api/lab/health  /.netlify/functions/lab-health  200
/*               /index.html                     200
